<title>USA: Sport-Haley Q1 may suffer from UPS strike.</title>
<headline>Sport-Haley Q1 may suffer from UPS strike.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sport-Haley Inc said Wednesday that a prolonged strike at United Parcel Service of America Inc could hurt its first quarter results.</p>
<p>The company said if the UPS strike continued for an extended period, its shipping expenses would increase over those in earlier quarters.</p>
<p>It also said shipment delays could cause decreases in sales if the strike continued without a short-term resolution.</p>
</text>
